{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "feature-flags",
  "title": "Feature Flags",
  "description": "How the services evaluate OpenFeature flags: evaluation rate, success and errors, served variants and resolution reasons, measured by the OpenTelemetry MetricsHook.",
  "tags": [
    "openfeature",
    "feature-flags",
    "lgtm"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": "-- Grafana --",
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "metrics_ds",
        "label": "Metrics datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        },
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
        "query": "label_values(feature_flag_evaluation_requests_total, job)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "feature_flag_key",
        "label": "Feature flag",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
        "query": "label_values(feature_flag_evaluation_requests_total{job=~\"$service\"}, feature_flag_key)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "5s",
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m",
      "30m",
      "1h",
      "2h",
      "1d"
    ]
  },
  "weekStart": "",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**How the services evaluate feature flags.** Every OpenFeature evaluation made through the OFREP provider is measured by the OpenTelemetry `MetricsHook` registered in `Garage.ServiceDefaults`: `feature_flag.evaluation_requests_total`, `feature_flag.evaluation_success_total` (with the served variant and the resolution reason), `feature_flag.evaluation_error_total` and the in-flight gauge `feature_flag.evaluation_active_count`. Each evaluation is also recorded as a `feature_flag.evaluation` span event on the request trace.\n\n**Try it:** start the `k6`, `k6-error` or `k6-prompt-score` load generator in the Aspire dashboard to produce evaluations, use the *Service* and *Feature flag* filters above to focus, then change a flag's `defaultVariant` or targeting in `src/Garage.AppHost/flags/flagd.json` and watch *Served Variants by Flag* and *Evaluation Reasons* change. Hover the ⓘ icon on any panel for how it is computed."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Evaluations",
      "description": "Flag evaluations per second across the selected services and flags, from `feature_flag_evaluation_requests_total`. Each API request to `/lemans/winners` evaluates three flags and `/test/error` two, so this is a multiple of the request rate.\n\nReads 0 while no load generator or user traffic is hitting the services.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(feature_flag_evaluation_requests_total{job=~\"$service\", feature_flag_key=~\"$feature_flag_key\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Evaluations/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Success Rate",
      "description": "Share of evaluations that resolved without an error: successes ÷ requests over the rate interval. Successful means the provider returned a value (any reason, including DEFAULT); it says nothing about which variant was served.\n\nAnything below 100% means a provider error — typically flagd being unreachable — in which case the SDK falls back to the default value passed in code. Colours: red < 95%, yellow < 99%, green otherwise.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(feature_flag_evaluation_success_total{job=~\"$service\", feature_flag_key=~\"$feature_flag_key\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(feature_flag_evaluation_requests_total{job=~\"$service\", feature_flag_key=~\"$feature_flag_key\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Success rate"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.95
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Errors",
      "description": "Failed evaluations per second from `feature_flag_evaluation_error_total`. Shows 0 (not *No data*) while nothing fails.\n\nTo see it move, stop the `flagd` resource in the Aspire dashboard while a load generator runs: evaluations keep answering with code defaults but every one of them is counted here. Turns red as soon as the rate is above zero.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(feature_flag_evaluation_error_total{job=~\"$service\", feature_flag_key=~\"$feature_flag_key\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Errors/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.001
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Evaluations In Flight",
      "description": "Number of evaluations currently in progress, from the `feature_flag_evaluation_active_count` up/down counter (incremented when an evaluation starts, decremented when it finishes).\n\nOFREP calls to flagd take a few milliseconds, so this normally hovers around 0 even under load; a value that keeps climbing means evaluations are stalling (slow or unreachable flagd).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(feature_flag_evaluation_active_count{job=~\"$service\", feature_flag_key=~\"$feature_flag_key\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "In flight"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Evaluations by Flag",
      "description": "Evaluations per second for each flag key. The shape mirrors the traffic of the endpoints that evaluate each flag: `/lemans/winners` evaluates `winners-count`, `enable-database-winners` and `slow-operation-delay`; `/test/error` evaluates `simulate-delay-ms` and `simulate-error`; `/test/prompt-score` evaluates `prompt-file`.\n\nUse the *Feature flag* filter to isolate one.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(feature_flag_key) (rate(feature_flag_evaluation_requests_total{job=~\"$service\", feature_flag_key=~\"$feature_flag_key\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{feature_flag_key}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Evaluations by Service",
      "description": "Evaluations per second per service (`job` = OpenTelemetry `service.name`). The .NET API service reports through the OpenFeature `MetricsHook`; this is where the Python chat service and the Go flags API would show up too once they export evaluation metrics, making it easy to compare how each service uses flags.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(job) (rate(feature_flag_evaluation_requests_total{job=~\"$service\", feature_flag_key=~\"$feature_flag_key\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Served Variants by Flag",
      "description": "Successful evaluations per second broken down by flag and by the variant that was actually served, from `feature_flag_evaluation_success_total`. This is the panel that proves a flag change took effect: when you edit `defaultVariant` or add targeting in `flagd.json`, the old variant's line drops to zero and the new one appears within a minute. Fractional rollouts show as several variants of the same flag running in parallel.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(feature_flag_key, feature_flag_result_variant) (rate(feature_flag_evaluation_success_total{job=~\"$service\", feature_flag_key=~\"$feature_flag_key\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{feature_flag_key}} = {{feature_flag_result_variant}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Evaluation Reasons",
      "description": "Why each value was resolved, per second and stacked so the top of the stack is the total success rate: `STATIC` — the flag has no targeting and the default variant was served; `TARGETING_MATCH` — a targeting rule (user id, fractional rollout, …) picked the variant; `DEFAULT` — the rule did not match and the flag's default variant was used; `DISABLED` — the flag is disabled and the code default was returned; `ERROR`/`CACHED` as reported by the provider.\n\nAdding targeting to a flag moves its traffic from `STATIC` to `TARGETING_MATCH`.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(feature_flag_result_reason) (rate(feature_flag_evaluation_success_total{job=~\"$service\", feature_flag_key=~\"$feature_flag_key\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{feature_flag_result_reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 40,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "STATIC"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "TARGETING_MATCH"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "DEFAULT"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "yellow"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "DISABLED"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "ERROR"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "CACHED"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "purple"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors by Flag and Exception",
      "description": "Failed evaluations per second by flag key and exception type (`exception` attribute added by the .NET `MetricsHook`, for example `HttpRequestException` or `TaskCanceledException`). Empty while every evaluation succeeds.\n\nStop the `flagd` resource in the Aspire dashboard to see errors appear for every flag being evaluated; restart it and they stop within a scrape interval.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(feature_flag_key, exception) (rate(feature_flag_evaluation_error_total{job=~\"$service\", feature_flag_key=~\"$feature_flag_key\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{feature_flag_key}} - {{exception}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Flags Overview",
      "description": "One row per flag key (matching the filters): current evaluations per second, total evaluations in the selected time range and how many distinct variants were served in that range.\n\n*Variants served* > 1 means the flag is doing targeting or a fractional rollout; 1 means every user gets the same value. Sorted by evaluation rate.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(feature_flag_key) (rate(feature_flag_evaluation_requests_total{job=~\"$service\", feature_flag_key=~\"$feature_flag_key\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by(feature_flag_key) (increase(feature_flag_evaluation_requests_total{job=~\"$service\", feature_flag_key=~\"$feature_flag_key\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "count by(feature_flag_key) (sum by(feature_flag_key, feature_flag_result_variant) (increase(feature_flag_evaluation_success_total{job=~\"$service\", feature_flag_key=~\"$feature_flag_key\"}[$__range])) > 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "feature_flag_key": 0,
              "Value #A": 1,
              "Value #B": 2,
              "Value #C": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "feature_flag_key": "Flag",
              "Value #A": "Evaluations/s",
              "Value #B": "Evaluations (time range)",
              "Value #C": "Variants served"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Evaluations/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "reqps"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Variants served"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "gradient"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "blue",
                      "value": 2
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Evaluations/s",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
